  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nAlphabet Inc.\nTicker Symbol: GOOGL\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nAlphabet Inc. is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $282,836 million\nOperating Income: $70,709 million  \nNet Income: $59,972 million\nTotal Assets: $402,392 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $282,836\nCost of Revenue         $169,701\nGross Profit           $113,134\nOperating Income        $70,709\nNet Income             $59,972\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $402,392\nTotal Liabilities      $160,956\nStockholders' Equity   $241,435"
